							"items": [
								{
									"question": "What do I need to run my first search?",
									"answer": "Start with the kind of company you want, a geography, and the characteristics that make it a good fit. For example, landscapers in California that offer commercial snow removal. [Verify signup and first-search requirements]"
								},
								{
									"question": "Can it find companies that match my specific criteria?",
									"answer": "Describe what a business actually does, then use Signals to check the criteria that matter to you. Acquisition searchers can describe their thesis too, but a matching company does not mean its owner wants to sell. [Verify geographic coverage, supported criteria, and custom Signal access]"
